desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "javascript"
	title: "Struct scan: JavaScript crypto.createCipher"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：JavaScript crypto.createCipher"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-js-createcipher"
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到已废弃的 crypto.createCipher，密钥派生使用弱哈希。

### 风险类型
weak-cryptographic-algorithm

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用 createCipheriv 并显式提供 IV 与认证模式。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://a.js": <<<POS
const crypto = require("crypto");
function e(k, x) { return crypto.createCipher("aes192", k).update(x); }

POS
	"safefile://s.js": <<<NEG
function e(k, x) { return x; }

NEG
)

crypto.createCipher(* as $a) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: JavaScript crypto.createCipher",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：JavaScript crypto.createCipher",
	message: "结构扫描：JavaScript crypto.createCipher",
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm",
}
